# SpecLoom Workflow

## Five independent peer orchestrators

`specloom-work-creator` · `specloom-implement` · `specloom-validator` · `specloom-tester` · `specloom-git`

**Never delegate peer → peer.** User invokes each separately.

## User entry

| Agent | Role |
|-------|------|
| **specloom-work-creator** | Planning |
| **specloom-implement** | Implementation (**specloom-worker** only, ≤10) |
| **specloom-validator** | Quality (**standardized-loop** only, ≤3) |
| **specloom-tester** | Tests (**test-loop** only, ≤5) |
| **specloom-git** | Git-only sessions |

## Session contract

Load **specloom-orchestrator-session**: work discovery → git start → scope → git merge → reply.

**Approval:** `/manual` (default), `/auto`, `/approve` — see **specloom-approval-mode** (implement, validator, tester only).

Each orchestrator runs git via **specloom-git-workflow** (shell), not by calling `@specloom-git`.

## Pipeline order (user manual)

```
work-creator → implement → validator → tester
```

## Git

Base branch **`ai-workflow`**.
